{"seq":2,"slug":"typed-wasm-interfaces","title":"类型安全 WASM 接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/typescript-integration/typed-wasm-interfaces","wordCount":857,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型安全-wasm-接口\">类型安全 WASM 接口</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>裸的 WASM 导出只有数值类型，在 TypeScript 里使用它既无类型提示也无安全保证，因此需要<strong>类型信息的桥接</strong>。可用的手段有三层：<code>wasm-bindgen</code> 自动生成 <code>.d.ts</code>（将 Rust 类型精确映射为 TS 类型）；Interface Types 提案（已演进为 Component Model）试图让引擎直接理解高级类型、消除胶水代码；面对第三方或 C/C++ 编译的 WASM，则只能手写 <code>.d.ts</code> 并配合运行时校验。工程实践中，生产项目普遍再包一层<strong>封装层</strong>，隐藏指针操作与内存管理，对外只暴露纯 TS 类型 API。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm-bindgen-typescript-输出\">wasm-bindgen TypeScript 输出</h2><p>wasm-bindgen 自动为导出的 Rust 函数和类型生成 <code>.d.ts</code> 文件，提供完整的 TypeScript 类型支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct ImageProcessor {&#10;    width: u32,&#10;    height: u32,&#10;    pixels: Vec&lt;u8&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl ImageProcessor {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new(width: u32, height: u32) -&gt; ImageProcessor {&#10;        ImageProcessor {&#10;            width,&#10;            height,&#10;            pixels: vec![0; (width * height * 4) as usize],&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn apply_blur(&amp;mut self, radius: f32) -&gt; bool {&#10;        if radius &lt;= 0.0 { return false; }&#10;        true&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]&#10;    pub fn width(&amp;self) -&gt; u32 { self.width }&#10;&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]&#10;    pub fn height(&amp;self) -&gt; u32 { self.height }&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn encode_png(processor: &amp;ImageProcessor) -&gt; Vec&lt;u8&gt; {&#10;    vec![]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    width: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    height: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pixels: Vec&#x3C;u8>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(width: u32, height: u32) -> ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            width,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            height,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pixels: vec![0; (width * height * 4) as usize],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn apply_blur(&#x26;mut self, radius: f32) -> bool {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if radius &#x3C;= 0.0 { return false; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn width(&#x26;self) -> u32 { self.width }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(getter)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn height(&#x26;self) -> u32 { self.height }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn encode_png(processor: &#x26;ImageProcessor) -> Vec&#x3C;u8> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec![]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 自动生成的 .d.ts&#10;export class ImageProcessor {&#10;  free(): void;&#10;  constructor(width: number, height: number);&#10;  apply_blur(radius: number): boolean;&#10;  readonly width: number;&#10;  readonly height: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function encode_png(processor: ImageProcessor): Uint8Array;&#10;&#10;export default function init(module_or_path?: InitInput | Promise&lt;InitInput&gt;): Promise&lt;InitOutput&gt;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动生成的 .d.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  free</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  apply_blur</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encode_png</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">processor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">module_or_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitInput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">InitInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">InitOutput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rust 类型</th>\n<th>生成的 TS 类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>i32</code> / <code>u32</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>直接映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i64</code> / <code>u64</code></td>\n<td><code>bigint</code></td>\n<td>BigInt 类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f32</code> / <code>f64</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>直接映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td><code>boolean</code></td>\n<td>直接映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;str</code> / <code>String</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>直接映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;u8&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Uint8Array</code></td>\n<td>TypedArray 映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T | undefined</code></td>\n<td>可选类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Result&lt;T, JsValue&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T</code>（失败时抛异常）</td>\n<td>异常映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 struct</td>\n<td><code>class</code></td>\n<td>带 <code>free()</code> 方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 生成的 <code>.d.ts</code> 文件中，所有导出的类都包含一个 <code>free()</code> 方法。TypeScript 编译器不会强制你调用它，但忘记调用会导致内存泄漏。考虑封装一个 <code>using</code> 模式或 <code>Disposable</code> 接口。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"interface-types-提案\">Interface Types 提案</h2><p>WASM Interface Types 提案旨在消除胶水代码，让 WASM 模块直接操作高级类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 当前方案&#10;        RUST1[&quot;Rust String&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;编码为 UTF-8 字节&quot;| MEM1[&quot;线性内存&quot;]&#10;        MEM1 --&gt;|&quot;JS 读取字节&quot;| JS_STR1[&quot;JS String&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Interface Types 提案&#10;        RUST2[&quot;Rust String&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;接口类型: string&quot;| IT[&quot;引擎直接转换&quot;]&#10;        IT --&gt; JS_STR2[&quot;JS String&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 当前方案\n        RUST1[\"Rust String\"] --&gt;|\"编码为 UTF-8 字节\"| MEM1[\"线性内存\"]\n        MEM1 --&gt;|\"JS 读取字节\"| JS_STR1[\"JS String\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Interface Types 提案\n        RUST2[\"Rust String\"] --&gt;|\"接口类型: string\"| IT[\"引擎直接转换\"]\n        IT --&gt; JS_STR2[\"JS String\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接口类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>当前状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>UTF-8 字符串</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>list&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>泛型列表</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>record</code></td>\n<td>命名字段的记录类型</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>variant</code></td>\n<td>带标签的联合类型</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flags</code></td>\n<td>位标志集合</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>可选值</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n<td>结果类型</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 未来的 Interface Types 语法（概念性示例）&#10;// 无需 wasm-bindgen，引擎直接理解高级类型&#10;// #[interface_type]&#10;// pub fn process_records(items: Vec&lt;Record&gt;) -&gt; Vec&lt;Record&gt; {&#10;//     items.into_iter()&#10;//         .filter(|r| r.active)&#10;//         .collect()&#10;// }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 未来的 Interface Types 语法（概念性示例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 无需 wasm-bindgen，引擎直接理解高级类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// #[interface_type]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// pub fn process_records(items: Vec&#x3C;Record>) -> Vec&#x3C;Record> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     items.into_iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//         .filter(|r| r.active)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//         .collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Interface Types 提案已演进为 Component Model 的一部分。当 Component Model 成熟后，wasm-bindgen 的角色可能从&quot;生成胶水代码&quot;转变为&quot;生成 WIT 接口定义&quot;。关注 WASI Preview 2 的进展。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"手动-d-ts-编写\">手动 .d.ts 编写</h2><p>在某些场景下（如直接使用 WAT 编写的模块或第三方 WASM），需要手动编写 TypeScript 类型声明。</p>\n<div class=